    "text": {
      "*": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en-GB\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>Cititrader will automatically permissions for ops, below I will explain what every permission does.\n</p>\n<div style=\"padding:3px;\">\n<table cellpadding=\"0\" style=\"border-style:dashed; width:95%; border-width:1px; padding:6px;\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td width=\"17%\"><div style=\"border-width: 1px; margin-top:4px; vertical-align:center; border-style: dotted; margin-bottom:5px; background-color:ivory; font-weight:400; text-align:center; font-family:droid-sans-mono; font-size:100%;\">\n<p><a href=\"/index.php?title=Interact_Script_Requirements&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Interact Script Requirements (page does not exist)\">traders.command.*</a>\n</p>\n </div>\n</td>\n<td><div style=\"border-width: 0px; vertical-align:center;margin-top:4px; border-style: dotted; margin-bottom:5px; text-align:left; margin-left:10px; font-weight:500; font-family:droid-sans-mono; font-size:80%;\">  Grants access to all trader commands [<b>Default</b>: op]\n </div>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<div style=\"padding:3px;\">\n<table cellpadding=\"0\" style=\"border-style:dashed; width:95%; border-width:1px; padding:6px;\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td width=\"17%\"><div style=\"border-width: 1px; margin-top:4px; vertical-align:center; border-style: dotted; margin-bottom:5px; background-color:ivory; font-weight:400; text-align:center; font-family:droid-sans-mono; font-size:100%;\">\n<p><a href=\"/index.php?title=Interact_Script_Requirements&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Interact Script Requirements (page does not exist)\">traders.command.create</a>\n</p>\n </div>\n</td>\n<td><div style=\"border-width: 0px; vertical-align:center;margin-top:4px; border-style: dotted; margin-bottom:5px; text-align:left; margin-left:10px; font-weight:500; font-family:droid-sans-mono; font-size:80%;\">  Can create traders using /trader create [<b>Default</b>: op]\n </div>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<div style=\"padding:3px;\">\n<table cellpadding=\"0\" style=\"border-style:dashed; width:95%; border-width:1px; padding:6px;\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td width=\"17%\"><div style=\"border-width: 1px; margin-top:4px; vertical-align:center; border-style: dotted; margin-bottom:5px; background-color:ivory; font-weight:400; text-align:center; font-family:droid-sans-mono; font-size:100%;\">\n<p><a href=\"/index.php?title=Interact_Script_Requirements&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Interact Script Requirements (page does not exist)\">traders.command.sellprice</a>\n</p>\n </div>\n</td>\n<td><div style=\"border-width: 0px; vertical-align:center;margin-top:4px; border-style: dotted; margin-bottom:5px; text-align:left; margin-left:10px; font-weight:500; font-family:droid-sans-mono; font-size:80%;\">  Can set sale prices of traders [<b>Default</b>: op]\n </div>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<div style=\"padding:3px;\">\n<table cellpadding=\"0\" style=\"border-style:dashed; width:95%; border-width:1px; padding:6px;\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td width=\"17%\"><div style=\"border-width: 1px; margin-top:4px; vertical-align:center; border-style: dotted; margin-bottom:5px; background-color:ivory; font-weight:400; text-align:center; font-family:droid-sans-mono; font-size:100%;\">\n<p><a href=\"/index.php?title=Interact_Script_Requirements&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Interact Script Requirements (page does not exist)\">traders.command.buyprice</a>\n</p>\n </div>\n</td>\n<td><div style=\"border-width: 0px; vertical-align:center;margin-top:4px; border-style: dotted; margin-bottom:5px; text-align:left; margin-left:10px; font-weight:500; font-family:droid-sans-mono; font-size:80%;\">  Can set purchase orders [<b>Default</b>: op]\n </div>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<div style=\"padding:3px;\">\n<table cellpadding=\"0\" style=\"border-style:dashed; width:95%; border-width:1px; padding:6px;\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td width=\"17%\"><div style=\"border-width: 1px; margin-top:4px; vertical-align:center; border-style: dotted; margin-bottom:5px; background-color:ivory; font-weight:400; text-align:center; font-family:droid-sans-mono; font-size:100%;\">\n<p><a href=\"/index.php?title=Interact_Script_Requirements&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Interact Script Requirements (page does not exist)\">traders.command.setwallet</a>\n</p>\n </div>\n</td>\n<td><div style=\"border-width: 0px; vertical-align:center;margin-top:4px; border-style: dotted; margin-bottom:5px; text-align:left; margin-left:10px; font-weight:500; font-family:droid-sans-mono; font-size:80%;\">  Set an npc's wallet type [<b>Default</b>: op]\n </div>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<div style=\"padding:3px;\">\n<table cellpadding=\"0\" style=\"border-style:dashed; width:95%; border-width:1px; padding:6px;\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td width=\"17%\"><div style=\"border-width: 1px; margin-top:4px; vertical-align:center; border-style: dotted; margin-bottom:5px; background-color:ivory; font-weight:400; text-align:center; font-family:droid-sans-mono; font-size:100%;\">\n<p><a href=\"/index.php?title=Interact_Script_Requirements&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Interact Script Requirements (page does not exist)\">traders.command.wallet</a>\n</p>\n </div>\n</td>\n<td><div style=\"border-width: 0px; vertical-align:center;margin-top:4px; border-style: dotted; margin-bottom:5px; text-align:left; margin-left:10px; font-weight:500; font-family:droid-sans-mono; font-size:80%;\">  Give/take from an npc wallet. [<b>Default</b>: op]\n </div>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<div style=\"padding:3px;\">\n<table cellpadding=\"0\" style=\"border-style:dashed; width:95%; border-width:1px; padding:6px;\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td width=\"17%\"><div style=\"border-width: 1px; margin-top:4px; vertical-align:center; border-style: dotted; margin-bottom:5px; background-color:ivory; font-weight:400; text-align:center; font-family:droid-sans-mono; font-size:100%;\">\n<p><a href=\"/index.php?title=Interact_Script_Requirements&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Interact Script Requirements (page does not exist)\">traders.command.disable</a>\n</p>\n </div>\n</td>\n<td><div style=\"border-width: 0px; vertical-align:center;margin-top:4px; border-style: dotted; margin-bottom:5px; text-align:left; margin-left:10px; font-weight:500; font-family:droid-sans-mono; font-size:80%;\">  Allows a player to disable an NPC (Close the Shop)[<b>Default</b>: op]\n </div>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<div style=\"padding:3px;\">\n<table cellpadding=\"0\" style=\"border-style:dashed; width:95%; border-width:1px; padding:6px;\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td width=\"17%\"><div style=\"border-width: 1px; margin-top:4px; vertical-align:center; border-style: dotted; margin-bottom:5px; background-color:ivory; font-weight:400; text-align:center; font-family:droid-sans-mono; font-size:100%;\">\n<p><a href=\"/index.php?title=Interact_Script_Requirements&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Interact Script Requirements (page does not exist)\">traders.command.enable</a>\n</p>\n </div>\n</td>\n<td><div style=\"border-width: 0px; vertical-align:center;margin-top:4px; border-style: dotted; margin-bottom:5px; text-align:left; margin-left:10px; font-weight:500; font-family:droid-sans-mono; font-size:80%;\">  Allows a player to enable an NPC (Open the Shop)[<b>Default</b>: op]\n </div>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<div style=\"padding:3px;\">\n<table cellpadding=\"0\" style=\"border-style:dashed; width:95%; border-width:1px; padding:6px;\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td width=\"17%\"><div style=\"border-width: 1px; margin-top:4px; vertical-align:center; border-style: dotted; margin-bottom:5px; background-color:ivory; font-weight:400; text-align:center; font-family:droid-sans-mono; font-size:100%;\">\n<p><a href=\"/index.php?title=Interact_Script_Requirements&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Interact Script Requirements (page does not exist)\">traders.command.cancel</a>\n</p>\n </div>\n</td>\n<td><div style=\"border-width: 0px; vertical-align:center;margin-top:4px; border-style: dotted; margin-bottom:5px; text-align:left; margin-left:10px; font-weight:500; font-family:droid-sans-mono; font-size:80%;\">  Allows a player to cancel out of any transaction or status of an Trader NPC [<b>Default</b>: true]\n </div>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<div style=\"padding:3px;\">\n<table cellpadding=\"0\" style=\"border-style:dashed; width:95%; border-width:1px; padding:6px;\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td width=\"17%\"><div style=\"border-width: 1px; margin-top:4px; vertical-align:center; border-style: dotted; margin-bottom:5px; background-color:ivory; font-weight:400; text-align:center; font-family:droid-sans-mono; font-size:100%;\">\n<p><a href=\"/index.php?title=Interact_Script_Requirements&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Interact Script Requirements (page does not exist)\">traders.command.link</a>\n</p>\n </div>\n</td>\n<td><div style=\"border-width: 0px; vertical-align:center;margin-top:4px; border-style: dotted; margin-bottom:5px; text-align:left; margin-left:10px; font-weight:500; font-family:droid-sans-mono; font-size:80%;\">  Allows a player to link an NPC to use their price lists. [<b>Default</b>: op]\n </div>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<div style=\"padding:3px;\">\n<table cellpadding=\"0\" style=\"border-style:dashed; width:95%; border-width:1px; padding:6px;\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td width=\"17%\"><div style=\"border-width: 1px; margin-top:4px; vertical-align:center; border-style: dotted; margin-bottom:5px; background-color:ivory; font-weight:400; text-align:center; font-family:droid-sans-mono; font-size:100%;\">\n<p><a href=\"/index.php?title=Interact_Script_Requirements&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Interact Script Requirements (page does not exist)\">traders.command.unlink</a>\n</p>\n </div>\n</td>\n<td><div style=\"border-width: 0px; vertical-align:center;margin-top:4px; border-style: dotted; margin-bottom:5px; text-align:left; margin-left:10px; font-weight:500; font-family:droid-sans-mono; font-size:80%;\">  Allows a player to unlink an NPC[<b>Default</b>: op]\n </div>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<div style=\"padding:3px;\">\n<table cellpadding=\"0\" style=\"border-style:dashed; width:95%; border-width:1px; padding:6px;\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td width=\"17%\"><div style=\"border-width: 1px; margin-top:4px; vertical-align:center; border-style: dotted; margin-bottom:5px; background-color:ivory; font-weight:400; text-align:center; font-family:droid-sans-mono; font-size:100%;\">\n<p><a href=\"/index.php?title=Interact_Script_Requirements&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Interact Script Requirements (page does not exist)\">traders.command.linkchest</a>\n</p>\n </div>\n</td>\n<td><div style=\"border-width: 0px; vertical-align:center;margin-top:4px; border-style: dotted; margin-bottom:5px; text-align:left; margin-left:10px; font-weight:500; font-family:droid-sans-mono; font-size:80%;\">  Allows a player to link a chest to an NPC [<b>Default</b>: op]\n </div>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<div style=\"padding:3px;\">\n<table cellpadding=\"0\" style=\"border-style:dashed; width:95%; border-width:1px; padding:6px;\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td width=\"17%\"><div style=\"border-width: 1px; margin-top:4px; vertical-align:center; border-style: dotted; margin-bottom:5px; background-color:ivory; font-weight:400; text-align:center; font-family:droid-sans-mono; font-size:100%;\">\n<p><a href=\"/index.php?title=Interact_Script_Requirements&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Interact Script Requirements (page does not exist)\">traders.command.unlinkchest</a>\n</p>\n </div>\n</td>\n<td><div style=\"border-width: 0px; vertical-align:center;margin-top:4px; border-style: dotted; margin-bottom:5px; text-align:left; margin-left:10px; font-weight:500; font-family:droid-sans-mono; font-size:80%;\">  Allows a player to unlink a chest to an NPC [<b>Default</b>: op]\n </div>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading3\"><h3 id=\"Individual_Wallet_Permissions\">Individual Wallet Permissions</h3><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Cititrader/Permissions&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Individual Wallet Permissions\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<div style=\"padding:3px;\">\n<table cellpadding=\"0\" style=\"border-style:dashed; width:95%; border-width:1px; padding:6px;\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td width=\"17%\"><div style=\"border-width: 1px; margin-top:4px; vertical-align:center; border-style: dotted; margin-bottom:5px; background-color:ivory; font-weight:400; text-align:center; font-family:droid-sans-mono; font-size:100%;\">\n<p><a href=\"/index.php?title=Interact_Script_Requirements&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Interact Script Requirements (page does not exist)\">traders.wallet.private</a>\n</p>\n </div>\n</td>\n<td><div style=\"border-width: 0px; vertical-align:center;margin-top:4px; border-style: dotted; margin-bottom:5px; text-align:left; margin-left:10px; font-weight:500; font-family:droid-sans-mono; font-size:80%;\">  Allows user to set traders to use their own private wallet. [<b>Default</b>: user]\n </div>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<div style=\"padding:3px;\">\n<table cellpadding=\"0\" style=\"border-style:dashed; width:95%; border-width:1px; padding:6px;\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td width=\"17%\"><div style=\"border-width: 1px; margin-top:4px; vertical-align:center; border-style: dotted; margin-bottom:5px; background-color:ivory; font-weight:400; text-align:center; font-family:droid-sans-mono; font-size:100%;\">\n<p><a href=\"/index.php?title=Interact_Script_Requirements&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Interact Script Requirements (page does not exist)\">traders.wallet.owner</a>\n</p>\n </div>\n</td>\n<td><div style=\"border-width: 0px; vertical-align:center;margin-top:4px; border-style: dotted; margin-bottom:5px; text-align:left; margin-left:10px; font-weight:500; font-family:droid-sans-mono; font-size:80%;\">  Allows user to set traders to use their owner's bank wallet. [<b>Default</b>: user]\n </div>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<div style=\"padding:3px;\">\n<table cellpadding=\"0\" style=\"border-style:dashed; width:95%; border-width:1px; padding:6px;\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td width=\"17%\"><div style=\"border-width: 1px; margin-top:4px; vertical-align:center; border-style: dotted; margin-bottom:5px; background-color:ivory; font-weight:400; text-align:center; font-family:droid-sans-mono; font-size:100%;\">\n<p><a href=\"/index.php?title=Interact_Script_Requirements&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Interact Script Requirements (page does not exist)\">traders.wallet.bank</a>\n</p>\n </div>\n</td>\n<td><div style=\"border-width: 0px; vertical-align:center;margin-top:4px; border-style: dotted; margin-bottom:5px; text-align:left; margin-left:10px; font-weight:500; font-family:droid-sans-mono; font-size:80%;\">  Allows user to set traders to use a bank account (ECONOMY PLUGIN MUST SUPPORT BANKS, USER MUST OWN BANK ACCOUNT). [<b>Default</b>: user ]\n </div>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<div style=\"padding:3px;\">\n<table cellpadding=\"0\" style=\"border-style:dashed; width:95%; border-width:1px; padding:6px;\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td width=\"17%\"><div style=\"border-width: 1px; margin-top:4px; vertical-align:center; border-style: dotted; margin-bottom:5px; background-color:ivory; font-weight:400; text-align:center; font-family:droid-sans-mono; font-size:100%;\">\n<p><a href=\"/index.php?title=Interact_Script_Requirements&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Interact Script Requirements (page does not exist)\">traders.wallet.admin</a>\n</p>\n </div>\n</td>\n<td><div style=\"border-width: 0px; vertical-align:center;margin-top:4px; border-style: dotted; margin-bottom:5px; text-align:left; margin-left:10px; font-weight:500; font-family:droid-sans-mono; font-size:80%;\">  Allows the user to set trader to ADMIN, unlimited money and items. [<b>Default</b>: op]\n </div>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<div style=\"padding:3px;\">\n<table cellpadding=\"0\" style=\"border-style:dashed; width:95%; border-width:1px; padding:6px;\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td width=\"17%\"><div style=\"border-width: 1px; margin-top:4px; vertical-align:center; border-style: dotted; margin-bottom:5px; background-color:ivory; font-weight:400; text-align:center; font-family:droid-sans-mono; font-size:100%;\">\n<p><a href=\"/index.php?title=Interact_Script_Requirements&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Interact Script Requirements (page does not exist)\">traders.wallet.town_bank</a>\n</p>\n </div>\n</td>\n<td><div style=\"border-width: 0px; vertical-align:center;margin-top:4px; border-style: dotted; margin-bottom:5px; text-align:left; margin-left:10px; font-weight:500; font-family:droid-sans-mono; font-size:80%;\">  Allows the user to set trader to use Town Bank (REQUIRES TOWNY PLUGIN, YOU NEED TO OWN THE NPC AND BE MAYOR OR ASSISTANT OF TOWN). [<b>Default</b>: op]\n </div>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261019145819\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.066 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.086 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 173/1000000\nRevision size: 3370/2097152 bytes\nPost‐expand include size: 13025/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 2567/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%